+           ((pvrFormat & (1 << 27)) | (pvrFormat & (1 << 26))) >> 26
+
+       which folds the twiddle flag in as the format's low bit and never looks
+       at bit 28. Twiddled ARGB1555 and twiddled RGB565 came out right; every
+       other combination did not. Twiddled ARGB4444 -- which is what
